@startuml
left to right direction

actor Buyer
actor Supplier
actor "PrimeRevenue Platform" as PrimeRevenue
actor Investor


Supplier -- (Sends invoice)
Buyer -- (Approves invoice)
PrimeRevenue -- (Converts approved invoice to a payment obligation, attaches IPU irrevocable payment undertaking)
Supplier -- (sells an invoice with IPU to Investor)
Investor -- (Pays Supplier for invoice immediately)
Investor -- (Activate Auto buying, e.g. from certain Buyers)


